<title>GERMANY: DSL-Bank chief to head up German Postbank -- paper.</title>
<headline>DSL-Bank chief to head up German Postbank -- paper.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dieter Boening, currently in charge of the DSL-Bank, is to become managing director of the Deutsche Postbank, according to a report to be published in Tuesday's Handeslblatt newspaper.</p>
<p>The paper said the 54-year-old Boening would be replacing Postbank's current head, the 66-year-old Guenter Schneider, on July 1.</p>
<p>The privatisation of Postbank, the banking arm of the German post office was last week cleared for sometime later this year.</p>
<p>-- Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
